  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Currently e-health systems are being implemented by governments and stakeholders to increase the effectiveness, efficiency and the quality of health care services. The Internet of things (IoT) as a relatively new technology is transforming e-health systems to further enhance health care services. However, this transformation concomitantly creates a need for effective performance evaluation frameworks of e-health systems in the IoT. Recommendation ITU-T Y.4908 addresses this need for effective performance evaluation frameworks of e-health systems in the IoT and includes: Performance evaluation frameworks for e-health systems in the IoT.</abstract>
